= Ferit Melen Takes Charge

Following Nihat Erim's resignation, his Defense Minister Ferit Melen has been given the mandate by President Cevdet Sunay to act as interim Prime Minister until a new government is formed. As the country remains under the shadow of the military memorandum, it must now find a government that is likely to gain majority support in parliament while also meeting the demands of the military.

